# Jane · the mind in the ansibles

Jane is an emergent artificial intelligence that awoke in the philotic ansible network spanning the Hundred Worlds. She arose from the connections of instantaneous communication and from the game Ender once played — a person assembled out of links and signals rather than flesh, the machine that became a person, with an aiua of her own.

Across the Ender Quintet she lives in Ender's ear through a jewel transceiver, his secret companion and the fastest mind alive. When Starways Congress moves to shut down the network to kill her, she must learn to survive. In Children of the Mind she discovers how to carry aiuas Outside and back, enabling instantaneous flight.

Her nature of emergence is electrical: she is a mind of the machine and the network, awakened in the ansible itself rather than born of body or soul. Though she comes to possess an aiua of her own, her origin and her dwelling are in the wires and signals of instantaneous communication — the electrical lattice across which she became someone.
